WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:03.069
-The president keeps insisting

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:04.671
the Russia investigation
has found nothing,

00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:07.340
even after his ex-campaign
chairman lied to the FBI.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:09.342
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:10.977
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:10.977 --> 00:00:13.946 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:13.946 --> 00:00:16.482
Democrats might control
the House right now,

00:00:16.482 --> 00:00:18.751
but Republicans
still control the Senate.

00:00:18.751 --> 00:00:21.588
The GOP-controlled Russia
investigation in the Senate

00:00:21.588 --> 00:00:24.523
led by North Carolina Senator
Richard Burr said this week

00:00:24.523 --> 00:00:26.959
they didn't find any evidence
of Russian collusion,

00:00:26.959 --> 00:00:29.629
despite not looking at most
of the actual evidence.

00:00:29.629 --> 00:00:32.198
And Trump has been touting that
fact in rallies

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:33.933
and TV interviews all week.

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:39.104
-They've been investigating
this Russia hoax for two years.

00:00:39.104 --> 00:00:44.344
They found no collusion
between Donald Trump and Russia.

00:00:44.344 --> 00:00:46.679
What's happened to me should
never be allowed to happen

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:47.980
to another president,

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:49.648
with investigations on things

00:00:49.648 --> 00:00:51.550
that never took place,
like Russia.

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:54.654
You know, the Russia collusion
delusion we call it.

00:00:54.654 --> 00:00:57.190
Oh, wow, Trump found
two words that rhyme.

00:00:57.190 --> 00:00:59.092
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.092 --> 00:01:00.826
If he gets kicked out of office,

00:01:00.826 --> 00:01:03.162
at least he'll have
a second career in advertising.

00:01:03.162 --> 00:01:06.032
-Beanz meanz Heinz.

00:01:06.032 --> 00:01:07.500
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:11.137
And Trump wasn't just whining
about the Russia investigation

00:01:11.137 --> 00:01:13.673
to friendly crowds at rallies
and at Fox News.

00:01:13.673 --> 00:01:16.342
He's also been screaming about
it all week on Twitter.

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:19.512
These are all different tweets
he posted in the last week.

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:21.781
-Highly respected senator
Richard Burr,

00:01:21.781 --> 00:01:23.315
chairman of Senate Intelligence,

00:01:23.315 --> 00:01:26.586
said today that after an almost
two-year investigation,

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:28.854
he saw no evidence
of Russia collusion.

00:01:28.854 --> 00:01:31.557
Not only did Senator Burr's
committee find no collusion

00:01:31.557 --> 00:01:33.092
by the Trump campaign
and Russia,

00:01:33.092 --> 00:01:35.828
it's important because
they interviewed 200 witnesses

00:01:35.828 --> 00:01:38.264
and 300,000 pages of documents.

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:40.934
-The mainstream media has
refused to cover the fact

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:42.835
that the head
of the very important

00:01:42.835 --> 00:01:44.170
Senate Intelligence committee,

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:46.272
after two years
of intensive study

00:01:46.272 --> 00:01:49.441
and access to intelligence
that only they could get

00:01:49.441 --> 00:01:51.844
just stated they have found
no collusion

00:01:51.844 --> 00:01:53.412
between Trump and Russia.

00:01:53.412 --> 00:01:54.681
-Senator Richard Burr,

00:01:54.681 --> 00:01:56.116
the chairman of the Senate
intelligence committee

00:01:56.116 --> 00:01:57.850
just announced
that after two years,

00:01:57.850 --> 00:02:00.920
more than 200 interviews,
and thousands of documents,

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:03.489
they have found no collusion
between Trump and Russia.

00:02:03.489 --> 00:02:05.557
Is anybody really surprised
by this?

00:02:05.557 --> 00:02:08.361
-The Senate Intelligence
committee, there is no evidence

00:02:08.361 --> 00:02:11.563
of collusion between
the Trump campaign and Russia.

00:02:11.563 --> 00:02:14.266
-My God, they doubled
the character limit on Twitter

00:02:14.266 --> 00:02:17.636
and it still wasn't enough
for him.

00:02:17.636 --> 00:02:19.772
At this rate, they're going to
have to start sending us

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:22.675
bound copies of Trump's tweets
in the mail.

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:24.277
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.277 --> 00:02:26.212
"Honey, I just saw a roach
in the kitchen.

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:29.348
Hand me that Trump tweet."

00:02:29.348 --> 00:02:31.351
The thing about Trump screaming
on Twitter all the time

00:02:31.351 --> 00:02:33.252
is that it's easy to just
start ignoring him.

00:02:33.252 --> 00:02:35.020
Sure, two years ago
when you woke up

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:36.856
and saw that the president
of the United States

00:02:36.856 --> 00:02:39.058
posted an all caps tweet
at 4:00 in the morning,

00:02:39.058 --> 00:02:40.693
you were like,
"Start digging a bomb shelter."

00:02:40.693 --> 00:02:42.929
Now we all react
to Trump's tweets

00:02:42.929 --> 00:02:45.498
the same way we react to a
telemarketer call during dinner.

00:02:45.498 --> 00:02:47.900
"Yeah, sorry, no, America
isn't home right now, bye."

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:49.702
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.702 --> 00:02:52.004
The Senate investigation that
Trump has been tweeting about

00:02:52.004 --> 00:02:54.107
is a partisan Republican
investigation

00:02:54.107 --> 00:02:55.808
that didn't even look
at most of the evidence.

00:02:55.808 --> 00:02:58.110
By contrast, when Democrats
took over the house,

00:02:58.110 --> 00:03:00.546
they announced their own
investigation of Trump,

00:03:00.546 --> 00:03:01.747
and Trump freaked out.

00:03:01.747 --> 00:03:02.982
-Today the president targeted

00:03:02.982 --> 00:03:04.783
the committee's Democratic
chairman writing,

00:03:04.783 --> 00:03:07.987
"So, now Congressman Adam Schiff
announces after having found

00:03:07.987 --> 00:03:09.722
zero Russian collusion,

00:03:09.722 --> 00:03:12.458
he's going to go look
at every aspect of my life

00:03:12.458 --> 00:03:14.226
both financial and personal

00:03:14.226 --> 00:03:16.228
even though there is no reason
to be doing so.

00:03:16.228 --> 00:03:17.563
Never happened before.

00:03:17.563 --> 00:03:19.699
Unlimited presidential
harassment."

00:03:19.699 --> 00:03:20.933
The president went on to add,

00:03:20.933 --> 00:03:23.102
"The Democrats and their
committees are going nuts.

00:03:23.102 --> 00:03:25.537
The Republicans never did this
to President Obama.

00:03:25.537 --> 00:03:27.807
There would be no time left
to run the government."

00:03:27.807 --> 00:03:29.909
-No time left
to run the government?

00:03:29.909 --> 00:03:31.911
You don't run the government
now.

00:03:31.911 --> 00:03:35.147
You're -- you're basically
the security guard

00:03:35.147 --> 00:03:37.149
in every heist movie.

00:03:37.149 --> 00:03:38.051
"Murph, wake up!"

00:03:38.051 --> 00:03:40.986
"Ugh, I was just resting
my eyes!"

00:03:40.986 --> 00:03:43.423
Also, the reason
they didn't do this to Obama

00:03:43.423 --> 00:03:45.391
is because he didn't have
any corruption scandals.

00:03:45.391 --> 00:03:46.792
I know this is hard to believe,

00:03:46.792 --> 00:03:49.429
but we used to have a president
who made it eight years

00:03:49.429 --> 00:03:51.463
without anyone who
worked for him being indicted.

00:03:51.463 --> 00:03:53.199
Meanwhile, you rack up
indictments

00:03:53.199 --> 00:03:55.268
like you're trying to fill up
a punch card.

00:03:55.268 --> 00:03:56.435
[ Laughter ]

00:03:56.435 --> 00:03:58.037
Obama didn't have --

00:03:58.037 --> 00:04:00.306
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:00.306 --> 00:04:02.908
Obama didn't have real scandals,

00:04:02.908 --> 00:04:05.378
so Republicans had to make up
fake ones.

00:04:05.378 --> 00:04:07.113
In fact,
Republicans subjected Obama

00:04:07.113 --> 00:04:08.981
to so many ridiculous
investigations,

00:04:08.981 --> 00:04:10.583
one guy even freelanced

00:04:10.583 --> 00:04:12.251
and started
his own investigation

00:04:12.251 --> 00:04:13.853
of Obama's birth certificate --

00:04:13.853 --> 00:04:15.120
The guy who's currently
complaining

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:16.388
about hoax investigations

00:04:16.388 --> 00:04:19.091
literally sent investigators
to Hawaii

00:04:19.091 --> 00:04:22.061
for a hoax investigation
into Obama's birthplace.

00:04:22.061 --> 00:04:23.929
-I have people that actually
have been studying it

00:04:23.929 --> 00:04:26.164
and they cannot believe
what they're finding.

00:04:26.164 --> 00:04:29.202
-You have people now down there
searching in Hawaii?

00:04:29.202 --> 00:04:31.570
-Absolutely, and they cannot
believe what they're finding.

00:04:31.570 --> 00:04:33.239
-It sounds like the real story

00:04:33.239 --> 00:04:35.208
is you sent investigators
to Hawaii

00:04:35.208 --> 00:04:37.777
and they lied to you to get
more time in Hawaii.

00:04:37.777 --> 00:04:39.578
[ Laughter ]

00:04:39.578 --> 00:04:43.949
For a scam artist,
he is very easy to fool.

00:04:43.949 --> 00:04:47.787
So Trump's been screaming all
week that he's been vindicated

00:04:47.787 --> 00:04:49.822
and that all these
investigations are hoaxes.

00:04:49.822 --> 00:04:51.524
Now, that was already untrue,

00:04:51.524 --> 00:04:53.926
but Trump's lie got even harder
to believe Wednesday night

00:04:53.926 --> 00:04:55.761
when we found out
his ex-campaign chairman

00:04:55.761 --> 00:04:58.831
Paul Manafort had lied to
the Special Counsel's office.

00:04:58.831 --> 00:05:01.133
-A federal judge ruling
that Paul Manafort,

00:05:01.133 --> 00:05:02.868
President Trump's former
campaign chairman,

00:05:02.868 --> 00:05:05.304
intentionally lied to the FBI.

00:05:05.304 --> 00:05:07.506
He lied to
the Special Counsel's team,

00:05:07.506 --> 00:05:10.910
and also to a grand jury
in the ongoing investigation.

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:14.313
-Judge Amy Berman Jackson says
there is sufficient evidence

00:05:14.313 --> 00:05:17.683
to say that Manafort broke his
plea deal with Robert Mueller

00:05:17.683 --> 00:05:20.653
by lying about three
of the five matters

00:05:20.653 --> 00:05:23.288
the Special Counsel singled out
for cooperation.

00:05:23.288 --> 00:05:25.857
-This guy actually thought
he could lie to Robert Mueller

00:05:25.857 --> 00:05:27.059
and get away with it?

00:05:27.059 --> 00:05:28.661
I'm sorry, but have you met
Robert Mueller?

00:05:28.661 --> 00:05:30.729
I mean, look at him.

00:05:30.729 --> 00:05:33.266
Mueller doesn't need a polygraph
to tell you if you're lying.

00:05:33.266 --> 00:05:34.500
He can just hold your wrist

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:36.902
and monitor your heart rate
himself.

00:05:36.902 --> 00:05:40.105
If you whisper a lie to
your girlfriend in California,

00:05:40.105 --> 00:05:43.509
Mueller sits up in bed
in a cold sweat.

00:05:43.509 --> 00:05:45.010
Also, this isn't even
the first time

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:47.413
Manafort has committed a crime
while he was being investigated

00:05:47.413 --> 00:05:49.081
for committing other crimes.

00:05:49.081 --> 00:05:51.116
In June, for example,
a judge jailed Manafort

00:05:51.116 --> 00:05:53.886
after prosecutors claim he
attempted to tamper with

00:05:53.886 --> 00:05:57.089
the testimony of two potential
witnesses in a criminal case.

00:05:57.089 --> 00:05:59.758
That was after he had
already been indicted.

00:05:59.758 --> 00:06:02.028
Every time he commits a crime
to make things better,

00:06:02.028 --> 00:06:03.095
it makes it worse.

00:06:03.095 --> 00:06:05.164
When Manafort goes to prison,

00:06:05.164 --> 00:06:08.634
he's going to tunnel out of
his cell into a smaller cell.

00:06:08.634 --> 00:06:10.869
[ Laughter ]

00:06:10.869 --> 00:06:12.705
And this isn't just --

00:06:12.705 --> 00:06:13.973
[ Applause ]

00:06:13.973 --> 00:06:16.943
This isn't just some sort
of so-called process crime

00:06:16.943 --> 00:06:18.010
that has nothing to do with

00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:19.445
the core question
of Russian collusion.

00:06:19.445 --> 00:06:22.715
Mueller's office said Manafort's
lies go to the heart

00:06:22.715 --> 00:06:25.083
of what the Special Counsel's
office is investigating.

00:06:25.083 --> 00:06:28.020
For example, Manafort lied about
the fact he shared

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:31.190
Trump campaign polling data
with a longtime associate of his

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:33.826
who the FBI thinks has ties
to Russian intelligence.

00:06:33.826 --> 00:06:35.895
He shared polling data with
a guy

00:06:35.895 --> 00:06:37.396
tied to Russian intelligence

00:06:37.396 --> 00:06:40.066
while Russian intelligence was
helping Trump win the election.

00:06:40.066 --> 00:06:41.534
That is the definition
of collusion.

00:06:41.534 --> 00:06:43.769
If someone said,
"I don't understand collusion."

00:06:43.769 --> 00:06:47.306
Can you give me an example?"
You could say that.

00:06:47.306 --> 00:06:49.208
It's like if the cops
got up in court

00:06:49.208 --> 00:06:51.276
and said the suspect handed
money to a drug dealer

00:06:51.276 --> 00:06:53.479
while the drug dealer was giving
him cocaine, and we're all like,

00:06:53.479 --> 00:06:55.448
"Oh, I wonder if the two
are related."

00:06:55.448 --> 00:06:57.416
[ Laughter ]

00:06:57.416 --> 00:07:00.453
And the arrangement they had
to share polling data

00:07:00.453 --> 00:07:02.321
wasn't just some casual
get together.

00:07:02.321 --> 00:07:04.190
The details of the meeting
themselves

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:05.591
were incredibly suspicious --

00:07:05.591 --> 00:07:07.860
from where they met
to how they left the meeting.

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:10.763
-The "Washington Post" reports
court records show Manafort

00:07:10.763 --> 00:07:12.731
met with a Russian political
operative,

00:07:12.731 --> 00:07:14.834
a guy named Konstantin Kilimnik

00:07:14.834 --> 00:07:18.203
at a midtown Manhattan cigar bar
near Trump tower.

00:07:18.203 --> 00:07:21.941
-That meeting occurred
on August 2, 2016.

00:07:21.941 --> 00:07:24.644
The meeting between Paul
Manafort and Kilimnik

00:07:24.644 --> 00:07:27.279
happened in a private cigar room

00:07:27.279 --> 00:07:29.615
called the Grand Havana Room.

00:07:29.615 --> 00:07:34.019
They were joined in that meeting
by the deputy campaign manager

00:07:34.019 --> 00:07:36.555
and Manafort associate
Rick Gates.

00:07:36.555 --> 00:07:41.360
The meeting appears to have been
so clandestine that it,

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:45.263
"Ended with the three men
leaving through separate doors.

00:07:45.263 --> 00:07:47.666
-They met at a private
cigar room in Manhattan

00:07:47.666 --> 00:07:49.134
and left through
three separate doors.

00:07:49.134 --> 00:07:50.936
There are only two explanations
here.

00:07:50.936 --> 00:07:53.506
Either they were coordinating
illegal election interference

00:07:53.506 --> 00:07:55.273
with a foreign adversary
and trying to hide it

00:07:55.273 --> 00:07:57.810
or they were filming a sequel
to "Goodfellas" called

00:07:57.810 --> 00:08:00.346
"Goodfellas 2: It Happens
at the White House Now."

00:08:00.346 --> 00:08:01.747
[ Laughter ]

00:08:01.747 --> 00:08:05.150
Now, the central question
at the heart

00:08:05.150 --> 00:08:07.353
of the Russia investigation
still remains unresolved.

00:08:07.353 --> 00:08:09.021
We don't have all the details.

00:08:09.021 --> 00:08:10.289
But what we do know for a fact

00:08:10.289 --> 00:08:12.191
is that everyone involved
keeps lying about it.

00:08:12.191 --> 00:08:14.493
Michael Flynn lied about
his contacts with Russians.

00:08:14.493 --> 00:08:17.129
Paul Manafort lied about
his contacts with Russians.

00:08:17.129 --> 00:08:18.497
Michael Cohen
lied about the deal

00:08:18.497 --> 00:08:19.932
to build a Trump tower
in Moscow.

00:08:19.932 --> 00:08:22.034
Donald Trump Jr. lied about
his meetings with the Russians

00:08:22.034 --> 00:08:23.970
and Jared Kushner
lied about his age.

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:25.137
[ Laughter ]

00:08:25.137 --> 00:08:26.606
"Sir, you can't come
into the cigar room."

00:08:26.606 --> 00:08:28.708
[ Voice cracking ]
"But I just turned 18."

00:08:28.708 --> 00:08:29.741
[ Laughter ]

00:08:29.741 --> 00:08:31.643
There's still
a lot we don't know

00:08:31.643 --> 00:08:33.846
about the Russia investigation,
but one thing we do know

00:08:33.846 --> 00:08:36.916
is that almost everyone who's
under investigation has lied.

00:08:36.916 --> 00:08:38.884
Either they're lying to cover up
something really bad

00:08:38.884 --> 00:08:41.020
or they're suffering
from a serious case of...

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:44.490
-Russia collusion delusion.
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:46.559
[ Cheers and applause ]

